DESCRIPTION:Gaspare Randazzo  is a teacher entering his 11th year in the c
 lassroom. When he’s not in the classroom\, you can find him doing stand-u
 p comedy where he talks about his life as a teacher and his experiences dea
 ling with students from all walks of life. His stories range from students 
 hating him and wanting to punch him in the face to them loving him and brin
 ging him school lunch trays to eat during every period. These non-conventio
 nal stories will have teachers and all others alike finding themselves laug
 hing and scratching their heads at just how outrageous they are!\n\nCouples
  Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 
 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the rig
 ht to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive
